\rowcolor{gray!10}
LR-multi   & \textit{mean} & 0.800$\pm$0.032 & 0.547$\pm$0.099 & 0.134$\pm$0.036 & 40.3$\pm$4.8\% & 4.12$\pm$2.55 \\
